\(\\mathrm{DiffTest}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"baa590d3c0c1f233\" href=\"?note=baa590d3c0c1f233\" title=\"43-df-difftest\">43-df-difftest</a>，其候选参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\subseteq2^\\omega\">\\(P\\subseteq2^\\omega\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DiffRandom}(X)\\iff\\forall P\\subseteq2^\\omega\\;\\forall U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{DiffTest}(P,U)\\Rightarrow X\\notin P\\cap\\bigcap_{n\\in\\mathbb N}U_n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{DiffRandom}(X)\\iff\\forall P\\subseteq2^\\omega\\;\\forall U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{DiffTest}(P,U)\\Rightarrow X\\notin P\\cap\\bigcap_{n\\in\\mathbb N}U_n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留交集逃离而非有限分量条件；强差随机性是另一概念。书外来源明确分列。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-difftest","status":"resolved","id":"baa590d3c0c1f233","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-difftest]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-difftest","status":"resolved","id":"baa590d3c0c1f233","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\mathrm{DiffTest}$ 见 [[43-df-difftest]]，其候选参数为 $P\\subseteq2^\\omega$ 与 $U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DiffTest}","display":false},{"tex":"P\\subseteq2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DiffRandom}(X)\\iff\\forall P\\subseteq2^\\omega\\;\\forall U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{DiffTest}(P,U)\\Rightarrow X\\notin P\\cap\\bigcap_{n\\in\\mathbb N}U_n\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1088,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-503","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-diffrandom]] — 差随机性"},{"id":"0d6fec7984f93939","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$；见 [[43-df-demuthrandom]]、[[43-df-diffrandom]]、[[43-df-mlrandom]]。"},{"id":"2e0bf937f1ca2ed8","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$；见 [[43-df-diffrandom]]、[[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]、[[43-df-jump]]。"},{"id":"2f46290baa611feb","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$；见 [[43-df-weak2random]]、[[43-df-diffrandom]]、[[43-df-mlrandom]]。"},{"id":"d84d11f6016c87de","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$；见 [[43-df-oberwolfach]]、[[43-df-diffrandom]]。"}],"outgoing":["baa590d3c0c1f233"]}